# 9Router — VPS Setup & Run

## Install
```
npm install -g 9router
```

## Run (background, exposed)
```bash
9router -t -n --log &
```

Server starts at `http://localhost:20128`, accessible via `http://187.77.146.83:20128/dashboard`.

## Stop
```bash
kill $(lsof -t -i:20128)
```

## Notes
- Runs on port 20128, bound to `0.0.0.0` (public).
- Dashboard: `/dashboard`
- OpenAI-compatible endpoint: `/v1`
- To run local-only: add `--host 127.0.0.1`
